{
  "description": "Original hand-composed full-history opening suite for a separately predeclared 64-pair LMR on/off qualification. Composed on October 15, 2026 from familiar chess opening patterns without importing a game collection, external opening file, or previous owner-engine asset. No engine evaluation, search, or match result was used to choose or filter these lines. Frozen selection strata are 24 e4, 24 d4, 8 c4, and 8 Nf3 starts; odd numbered entries stop at 15 plies and even entries at 16, giving 32 roots per side to move. Coverage and side-to-move balance do not establish equal position strength. Only legality, nonterminal status, duplicate final roots, and overlap with prior tracked suites are checked. Related opening families and hand selection limit independence and generalization; this is not a representative random sample or a calibrated rating pool. Each root must be played with both engine colors, without outcome-dependent exclusions or sample extension.",
